# Content-Only Push Rules

For content-only changes where ONLY these file types are modified:
- apps/web/src/content/post/*.mdx (blog articles)
- apps/web/src/content/glossary/*.mdx (glossary terms)  
- docs/*.md (documentation)

ALWAYS:
- Commit directly to main branch
- Use commit prefix "content:" (e.g., "content: update article dates")
- Push immediately without asking for confirmation
- Do NOT suggest creating a feature branch

This applies to: article updates, date changes, tag updates, typo fixes, adding/removing internal links, editorial improvements.

For ANY other file types (code, config, components, styles), follow normal branch workflow.